<title>NETHERLANDS: ING says share placement to raise $250-500m.</title>
<headline>ING says share placement to raise $250-500m.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Financial services group ING Groep NV (ING) said on Thursday it expected a placement of existing shares in the United States would raise between $250 and $500 million.  </p>
<p>ING earlier announced it planned a share placement to coincide with its planned listing on the New York Stock Exchange in June.</p>
<p>&quot;We are going to place existing shares for an amount of ...between $250 and $500 million,&quot; executive board chairman Aad Jacobs told a results news conference.</p>
<p>He said the listing was expected to go ahead on June 12.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
